"Set the billing day so statements are split into cycles; the card's page shows what's due, and Pay records the payment. Tag a purchase “Due now” to make it due at once, or “Excluded from target” to leave it out of the card's monthly usage target.": "設定結帳日，帳單就會依週期劃分；卡片頁面會顯示應繳金額，按「繳付」即可記錄付款。將消費標記為「Due now」可立即列為應繳，標記為「Excluded from target」則不計入該卡的每月使用目標。",
