"Tap + on the Trans. tab. Pick Income, Expense or Transfer, then the amount, category and account. The keypad has a calculator (÷ × − +). Save closes the form; Continue keeps it open for the next entry. Swipe left or right on the Trans. tab to change month (or tab, in Configuration › Swipe).": "點選「帳單」分頁上的 +。選擇「收入」、「支出」或「轉帳」，再輸入金額、類別與帳戶。鍵盤內建計算機（÷ × − +）。「儲存」會關閉表單；「繼續」則保持開啟，方便輸入下一筆。在「帳單」分頁向左或向右滑動即可切換月份（或切換分頁，於 設定 › 滑動 中設定）。",
"Tap a rule to change it. Stopping a rule keeps the transactions it already created.": "輕點規則即可變更。停止規則後，已建立的交易會保留。",
"Tap an entry to view it, then edit. The ⋮ menu copies it (with today's date or the entry's date), deletes it or saves it as a bookmark. Bookmarks (☆ on the Trans. tab) are ready-made entries you can add in one tap.": "點選一筆記錄即可檢視，再進行編輯。⋮ 選單可複製該記錄（使用今天日期或記錄日期）、刪除，或儲存為書籤。書籤（「帳單」分頁上的 ☆）是現成的記錄，只要點一下就能新增。",
